---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /topics/
title: Topics
description: Threads that run through what Jamie Thingelstad has built.
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Topics</h1>
  <p class="lede">Threads that run through several things. Membership is declared on each thing.</p>
</section>
<ul class="topic-list">
  {% for topic in site.topics %}
  <li>
    <h2><a href="{{ topic.page }}">{{ topic.title }}</a> <span class="count">{{ topic.things | length }}</span></h2>
    <p>{{ topic.description }}</p>
    <p class="muted">{% for thing in topic.things %}<a href="{{ thing.page }}">{{ thing.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
